{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：23:00 2026-11-16 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑兩度遭叫錯名  路人誤認蔡一智後再狂嗌「阿健」  出道40年竟要街頭停步自我介紹\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl_square/19edbe216e1871be59f20753567f6b60/2026-11/Copy_of_KF__83.png\"/>\n<p>草蜢成員蔡一傑近日現身紅館，一落車即引來大批粉絲和途人圍觀。不料，現場有路人竟對著他大喊其胞兄的名字：「蔡一智！」面對尷尬場面，蔡一傑非常有風度地報以微笑，並溫柔糾正道：「我係蔡一傑」，展現出超高EQ與親民態度，贏得不少網民讚賞。然而尷尬場面並未結束，隨後竟有人變本加厲，對著正步入後台的蔡一傑不停大叫：「阿健！阿健！影張相呀！」面對接連被叫錯名字，蔡一傑依舊保持好脾氣，一邊揮手一邊步入紅館。</p>\n<h2>網民替蔡一傑感不值</h2>\n<p>事件曝光後隨即掀起網上熱議。網民對於部分途人的無禮態度紛紛予以譴責，留言怒轟：「叫完蔡一智，人哋好有禮貌糾正咗，仲要不停叫人『阿健』，接連叫錯人名真係第一次見，仲要連句sorry都冇！」更有網民直言現場叫喊的語氣極不尊重：「又認錯人，又用喝令嘅態度，咁樣嗌破喉嚨都唔會有藝人同你影相！」亦有粉絲感嘆草蜢縱橫樂壇多年，蔡一傑已是殿堂級歌手，如今竟還要在現場自我介紹，實在令人無奈。</p>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑於2024年10月20日在IG表示做完腦腫瘤切除手術。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d0b8502cdcab1020b5332a3a0e60e6d/2024-10/djremus_choy_1729397522_3482761306875543860_1837431667.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑的開腦手術，傷口觸目驚心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cbd00b0138f04f1586bd4d71925c8bd0/2024-10/djremus_choy_1729397522_3482761306883861696_1837431667.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑手術後首次露面，慶祝58歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76315e1c310bbe017393d33f2c08ee55/2025-02/CHOI_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑今年2月與粉絲慶祝59歲生日，精神極好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a25d589d2ee9b1248e27d41aec45ad9/2026-02/DSC06988.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑早前孤身到茶餐廳醫肚，曝光最新狀態。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8334659fe94d92e28a3cb6ccc8927d03/2026-05/1_4_81.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑明顯消瘦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be11a55db87a91aa6eef04e3181dc515/2026-05/2_3_94.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑狀態只屬一般。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc9e958c3c64e63cb5882e47d7a8ab60/2026-05/3_98.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑親自拎手機跟粉絲自拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87c33cf7a39b7956e64af0a029f6fdae/2026-05/4_15_65.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"草蜢演唱會紅館騷4月開鑼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68e4e21dc1fba10709cebfbebf4fc450/2026-04/thumbnail_5__22.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"草蜢在台上又唱又跳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e555cf508c966699c9dbde97350ef0fa/2026-04/thumbnail_7__22.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早前英超球隊曼城與意甲球隊國際米蘭在香港啟德體育園上演友誼賽，吸引大批球迷入場，當中包括蔡一智。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b045459e6644cb5fc2ae9c9edbdb0ae/2026-08/1_6_6.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一智帶同妻兒朝聖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/74b08e32d542dd9d8e3fda635f4a3dff/2026-08/2_6_4.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一智在場內不斷打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4902a2d835c8fce4ef7838c27724b83/2026-08/3_5_4.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃建東分享衛蘭演唱會，蔡一傑、蔡一智擔任嘉賓的影片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d85e330da6ba6b8a47b9f2d3b33fe7c7/2026-11/BUN_9939.jpg\"/>\n<h2>衛蘭請草蜢做嘉賓變「蔡一蘭」</h2>\n<p>其實，蔡一傑當日現身紅館，是與哥哥蔡一智一同為《衛蘭演唱會2026》擔任表演嘉賓。不過同屬草蜢的蘇志威因不在港而未能到場，令草蜢難得「三缺一」。這幕有趣的畫面引來網民笑指衛蘭加入了草蜢，變成了「蔡一蘭」；連藝人黃建東也在Threads上以此開玩笑，分享演唱會影片並風趣地介紹她為「蔡一蘭」，令網民捧腹大笑。</p>\n<h2>草蜢演唱會群星撐場：</h2>\n<img alt=\"草蜢早前開演唱會邀請陳奕迅擔任頭場嘉賓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5477b4456ef213a7bae17c84aca10ab1/2026-04/thumbnail_11__20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"草蜢與陳奕迅鬥舞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/309513fd60324a19319434b6746eedce/2026-04/thumbnail_13__11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"草蜢送上匹克球拍給陳奕迅作為禮物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5855c45c2a60608bf53c3b5ae304392a/2026-04/thumbnail_14__13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳奕迅大爆暗戀劉小慧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3169dd12b577c2c3727a3c82f06f451e/2026-04/thumbnail_15__12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳奕迅最憎情敵蘇志威。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e30e67054d2d7fc6fd8935cb66ab907/2026-04/thumbnail_17__8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑認識陳奕迅已久，但從來沒有一起同台合唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/587fd71941d19463b55f3ba6bf2aa374/2026-04/thumbnail_18__8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"草蜢與陳奕迅擔好合拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/410327ad16155a02ca1c7b1bd7b5e03f/2026-04/thumbnail_19__8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"草蜢感性發言。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be57ba53d311b1bf38727af3038f74fe/2026-04/thumbnail_20__4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳奕迅亮相掀起高潮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/200671f2569d6ac9e7b12e5f1d8bc437/2026-04/thumbnail_21__2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳奕迅夠鬼馬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/185c985bf04c338b9820112b33dc6151/2026-04/thumbnail_22__4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"觀眾好熱情回應草蜢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e364f1b3f0be23dca0f2868c0d46fb8/2026-04/thumbnail_42__2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"草蜢演出成集體回憶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c2ff89cedaa12679cf6cb12c586367cf/2026-04/thumbnail_43__2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑開心可以着到背心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41c159d8674dc72a81d2ae3232ba3d76/2026-04/thumbnail_44__3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一智感恩難得可以開40周年演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d49a9b9fc9be3acef71e8def142913cf/2026-04/thumbnail_45__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一智被抬起。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e2a91f70acbe4017b6f70e1755fc8643/2026-04/thumbnail_52__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"草蜢經歷過高山低谷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ad694cff681dfc81820a8ddfb363144/2026-04/thumbnail_53__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑抱病上陣搏到盡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d1f98033d3e820b1f5fef639bed7965/2026-04/thumbnail_54__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"草蜢演出精彩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/abe1b7d486b76d2b039aad96ec3b4b09/2026-04/thumbnail_55_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑用意志力及平常心克服。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47b19f6713d5033a4970eb1a20557f09/2026-04/thumbnail_56_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一智落力演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c755d34d40aca7827319c8527b461f7a/2026-04/thumbnail_58_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇志威一早知陳奕迅嬲自己。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/914cdc146786d178be9eefc083e6d400/2026-04/thumbnail_59_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"草蜢換上粉色戰衣出場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cda08fa2605932a2d01947a34db1df0a/2026-04/thumbnail_63_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一傑妖得有型格。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e3039581bbd36fa193010b8c51c1682/2026-04/thumbnail_64_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"草蜢演唱會大成功。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69a729c06e2ebaa375763c2f8af9f5ef/2026-04/thumbnail_1__38.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"草蜢預告演唱會有不少「盲盒」安排。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/43402ca415a1ed6cc39fbdba4ab9adb8/2026-04/thumbnail_2__32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣夫婦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a623d575b4eedd5c63d80088bb6d6ca/2026-04/thumbnail_34__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉小慧捧場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8438b0f8992f2cd5be70d91f7a9ce2d/2026-04/thumbnail_23__6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"關之琳及顧紀筠。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf3f326dd366a3685031f2062a0cb8f7/2026-04/thumbnail_32__2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"老闆林建岳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/99f247e29126d10e9e5e32749d1fa475/2026-04/thumbnail_33__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡一智囡囡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/092141c15c6817a5cb71ec0372a201c1/2026-04/thumbnail_67_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃子華及金燕玲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e588328dd32c27a120fc98659d550a7/2026-04/thumbnail_68_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T15:19:40.576565+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":603,"images":46,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T15:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T03:41:19.634338+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T15:13:12.332693+00:00","content_hash":"822c073055d69a127e6f82c1e49727483995df1ae93e16fa9a76a2dc87e90923","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}